window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Seventeen-year-old Whitney Monroe is a child of untapped potential whose only outlet into the world is through her computer and the cybernetic wilderness that she has limitless access to. Better than most hackers, Whiney engages in cybervigilantism but also knows that she's more than a little drawn to uncovering secrets. Eventually she's going to get caught, but how many dark and mysterious sites can she stop before someone stops her? </p>"; 
